2. SOURCE-AVAILABLE PURPOSE

The Software is made source-available to permit transparency, study, audit,
learning, security review, private experimentation, contribution, and lawful
use of official LeoMiniGames software while preserving central control over
redistribution, alternative builds, official branding, and the YoungLion
publisher ecosystem.

Availability of source code does not make the Software open source or free
software.

3. PERMITTED USE

Subject to this License, the Licensor grants each lawful recipient a worldwide,
non-exclusive, royalty-free, non-transferable license to:

(a) view, inspect, study, audit, and analyze the Software;

(b) benchmark and test the Software, provided published results are not
    materially falsified or represented as official YoungLion results;

(c) make Private Copies reasonably necessary for installation, backup,
    development, testing, debugging, security review, and disaster recovery;

(d) compile and run the Software or a Modified Version on devices or
    infrastructure the recipient lawfully controls for private, personal,
    educational, research, evaluation, development, testing, or internal use;

(e) use Official Releases for their intended end-user purpose;

(f) modify the Software and create Modified Versions solely for Private Use;

(g) create Publisher Packages through Public Developer Interfaces under
    Section 8; and

(h) create a contribution fork strictly under Section 7.

No other rights are granted.

4. NO REDISTRIBUTION

Except as expressly allowed by Sections 7 and 8, or by a separate written
agreement from the Licensor, you may NOT:

(a) Distribute the Software, even if unmodified;

(b) Distribute any Modified Version, fork, derivative, port, translation,
    rebrand, repackaging, unofficial build, patched build, or alternative
    edition;

(c) publish source or binaries to an application store, package registry,
    binary repository, container registry, download site, mirror, torrent,
    software archive, marketplace, mod platform, or similar distribution
    channel;

(d) sell, sublicense, rent, lease, assign, transfer, bundle, or provide copies
    of the Software or a Modified Version to customers, clients, affiliates,
    contractors, or other third parties;

(e) incorporate a material part of the Software into another product that is
    Distributed;

(f) distribute an installer, launcher, APK, AAB, IPA, AppImage, DMG, EXE,
    package, archive, image, or other artifact containing the Software unless
    authorized as an Official Release;

(g) operate a public mirror or alternative release channel for the Software;

(h) remove, obscure, or materially alter copyright, license, attribution,
    integrity, or source-availability notices; or

(i) represent any unofficial copy or Modified Version as an Official Release.

You may link to an Official Channel so another person can obtain an authorized
copy directly from the Licensor.

5. NO COMPETING DISTRIBUTION OR REBRANDED HOST

Without prior written permission from the Licensor, you may not use the
Software or a material part of it to create, maintain, or distribute:

(a) a competing or substitute LeoMiniGames host, launcher, client, marketplace,
    package manager, catalog application, or rebranded edition;

(b) an alternative YoungLion-compatible host derived from the Software;

(c) a white-label or OEM distribution derived from the Software; or

(d) a service whose primary purpose is to provide third parties with copies of
