This Section does not prohibit independently created interoperable software
that does not copy protected Software material and is otherwise lawful.

6. PRIVATE MODIFICATIONS

Private modifications are permitted under Section 3.

Private modification permission does not include a right to publish, share,
upload, sell, sublicense, or otherwise Distribute the Modified Version.

If a modification includes Third-Party Components, their separate terms remain
